{"id":"n28325-1-7","stage":2,"title":"놓아두다 · 放在","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28325-1-7-1","ko":"이 서류들을 어디에 놓을까요?","zh":"这些文件应该放在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"서류들을","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서류들을","audio":"/audio/8d1d73e9613b0248b2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓을까요","audio":"/audio/62b21ced431faf6c824a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"